// A 3차 수정: 잉크병 뚜껑 윗면 3행(y=7~9), 도장 머리 윗면 3행(y=10~12)만 위로 확장.
@size 48 32
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat a wood 1
@mat b wood 2
@mat c wood 3
@mat d wood 4
@mat e wood 5
@mat f wood 6
@mat g wood 7
@mat h linen 2
@mat i linen 3
@mat j linen 4
@mat k linen 5
@mat l linen 6
@mat m iron 1
@mat n iron 2
@mat o iron 3
@mat p iron 4
@mat q iron 5
@mat r brass 2
@mat s brass 4
@mat t red 2
@mat u red 4
@layer counter
@mblock 0 13
= 1c 46g 1b
= 1g 46f 1b
= 1g 46f 1b
= 1g 46f 1b
= 1g 46f 1b
= 1g 46f 1b
= 1c 46e 1b
= 1c 46d 1b
= 48b
= 1c 12f 1c 2b 1c 12f 1c 2b 1c 12f 1c 2b
= 1c 1f 10d 1e 1c 2b 1c 1f 10d 1e 1c 2b 1c 1f 10d 1e 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b 1c 1e 10d 1c 1c 2b
= 1c 12e 1c 2b 1c 12e 1c 2b 1c 12e 1c 2b
= 48b
@layer grain
// 길이가 다른 조용한 상판 나뭇결.
@mblock 2 15
ee...............eeee.................eeeee
@mblock 18 17
eee............ee
@px 5 25 wood:5 6 25 wood:5 10 28 wood:3 21 27 wood:5 22 27 wood:5 27 24 wood:3 37 24 wood:5 38 24 wood:5 41 28 wood:3 42 28 wood:3
@layer divider
// 낮은 중앙 칸막이의 꼭대기 수평면 3행, 남쪽 세운 면 5행.
@mblock 19 6
cggggggggb
gffffffffb
gggggggggb
ceeeeeeeeb
cfddddddcb
ceddddddcb
ceddddddcb
cbbbbbbbbb
@layer documents
// 종이 더미: 넓은 윗면 3행과 어긋난 종이 가장자리.
@mblock 5 10
.kkkkkkkkk.
.klllllllk.
.kliillllk.
ikkkkkkkkh.
.hjjjjjjjhh
ijkkkkkkkkh
.hiiiiiiiih
@layer inkwell
// 잉크병 뚜껑: y=7~9 윗면, y=10 어두운 남쪽 면 유지.
@mblock 32 7
.qqq.
.qqq.
.qqq.
.ono.
.npn.
npqon
mpoon
mpoon
.nnn.
@layer stamp
// 도장 머리: y=10~12 윗면, y=13 남쪽 면; 기존 목과 밑판 유지.
@mblock 40 10
.sss.
.sss.
.sss.
.rrr.
..c..
..b..
tuutt
.ttt.
